              <lg xml:id="m-e80b0fc8-3984-4aee-b773-db46fff3a970">
                <l xml:id="m-0244af99-afa5-414e-ac83-f1e74557e245" facs="#m-73dfcf41-9363-4932-a14a-0e3e4c9dd5ec" label="text-like">loth Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-6cd9c7a9-80be-4e4f-b9dc-5d6fa3f1439e" facs="#m-90abaa45-6ab5-4577-a2d1-6e05dba6ce27" label="ambiguous">1021</l><l xml:id="m-e36a604b-8428-4466-a9ae-a142df143044" facs="#m-6b0b5517-277d-4da0-b78d-6ded83b6f9cb" label="lyrics-like">et exáudi me. Gló-ri-a Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-c9864973-7b8e-40e6-9efe-d2a31df02594" facs="#m-d084ed0e-6b76-4ed7-a2be-41565de8c8c7" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-e2c55d71-3d43-4ff3-9464-fc7ac3107c71" facs="#m-84082108-70e4-4619-b70f-649494d85e90" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui omnipoténtiam tuam  missa curréntes, *caeléstium bonó¬</l><l xml:id="m-6f7d5326-1321-4a95-b4e5-9a1ec191f2fa" facs="#m-af4bd025-f6a3-481b-a024-4e2286413e7d" label="lyrics-like">I parcéndo máxime et miserándo</l><l xml:id="m-39c1b2a8-2fd8-4e18-ae57-6c796ec743ff" facs="#m-64c7e63c-b7d3-4fbd-b088-45b45ec645ff" label="lyrics-like">rum fácias esse consórtes. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-132a1390-8111-48c6-8f36-b4817b6db7b4" facs="#m-4c8e33c2-b677-4c78-97de-05c20b1204b4" label="lyrics-like">maniféstas: t multíplica super nos</l><l xml:id="m-a4d1b916-8fac-4950-9c4c-adaa1a339265" facs="#m-bb7316ee-1ad7-43df-bfa0-ff4900ccf674" label="ambiguous">minum.</l><l xml:id="m-2c22ec03-13a8-4bc5-b82c-47875148ddc4" facs="#m-2a3afdf9-a2fb-4def-906b-3c1e8b50b0c6" label="lyrics-like">misericórdiam tuam; ut ad tua pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-41979991-2127-4b66-9419-51a9790d5c08" facs="#m-64b03994-c38f-44d7-aa90-1b1327d89d31" label="text-like">2. A cunctis. p. 498. — 3. At the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-d2ecd638-3489-484b-9702-76f07075950d" facs="#m-53eb0e24-fb8e-491f-8120-9d6391656c35" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. I. Cor. 12.</l><l xml:id="m-bd3395aa-b701-49e6-8b1e-2a95344c15d8" facs="#m-549a3030-5823-431c-ada8-295ab98972fe" label="lyrics-like">LRatres: Scitis quóniam cum autem datur manifestátio Spiritus</l><l xml:id="m-a989f3b5-f1a8-466c-ae84-13bc40f6e406" facs="#m-2e67b838-a687-46b8-813e-e1f99c339407" label="lyrics-like">ad utilitátem. Alii quidem per Spi¬</l><l xml:id="m-8029b682-c33d-43b2-a814-c34d3f3a46f4" facs="#m-60fcfbbd-3219-4284-97f3-04dcba60739a" label="lyrics-like">Gentes essétis, ad simulácra</l><l xml:id="m-1540a070-5d32-41c4-8241-1d73688c1179" facs="#m-52350bf7-b8b5-4873-a29d-15a379ccf4ac" label="lyrics-like">muta prout ducebámini eúntes. Ideo</l><l xml:id="m-83987be9-5d76-4f47-bafa-8f55223c005a" facs="#m-3c50e003-0a1e-4608-97bd-fffe38176569" label="lyrics-like">ritum datur sermo sapiéntiae: álii</l><l xml:id="m-54a9a4d9-6aae-436c-b5ed-67997f554b40" facs="#m-40497331-5b6c-47d9-9119-17d9f215a8c7" label="lyrics-like">notum vobis fácio, quod nemo in</l><l xml:id="m-5c44e567-005f-4f25-a61d-7f7b7cecb6d7" facs="#m-1e7d78a6-e5bb-42d3-9afe-9228090875d2" label="lyrics-like">autem sermo sciéntiae secúndum</l><l xml:id="m-1673d405-abb3-4333-a3d6-1ab6a75bac92" facs="#m-170dff3a-3755-43d0-b3f1-285ba529bec0" label="lyrics-like">Spiritu Dei loquens, dicit anáthema</l><l xml:id="m-886c3a25-7c6c-4ac3-972e-bf4e09f24ea8" facs="#m-f7c5290b-633f-481c-a541-0712a10ed948" label="lyrics-like">eúmdem Spiritum: álteri fides in</l><l xml:id="m-5a674e69-0809-402a-8f23-ee7ff180d2c8" facs="#m-9705fc1f-337c-43c8-bb6e-806079989aca" label="lyrics-like">Jesu. Et nemo potest dícere, Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-e6612330-3cb4-4e99-9923-11716dfe63ea" facs="#m-3c2ffcfa-5cb3-4525-b296-a87dea8cbe70" label="lyrics-like">eódem Spiritu: álii grátia sanitá¬</l><l xml:id="m-6e56111e-cf4b-484f-bfaa-7c77bb94b54f" facs="#m-dc2099c5-3abf-4929-9f5a-e21ec5f81a2b" label="lyrics-like">tum in uno Spíritu: álii operátio</l><l xml:id="m-cf3f8d6a-b9db-4f60-adcd-0ae8c5e66d09" facs="#m-41992d21-afa7-464d-a4af-33341b3fc638" label="lyrics-like">nus Jesus, nisi in Spíritu Sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-4b1ee40a-dc64-4648-99f0-bd333bad376d" facs="#m-6b6c2d9f-df66-41e0-b527-3e196e695267" label="lyrics-like">virtútum, álii prophetia, álii discré¬</l><l xml:id="m-6c6f085f-dcac-4583-a9c8-dfb6076fb287" facs="#m-7c01ef2c-f15f-4ecf-97a5-5c64dfd2972f" label="lyrics-like">Divisiónes vero gratiárum sunt,</l><l xml:id="m-5c171fdb-726b-44af-969d-00bc3de06554" facs="#m-37f033de-93ed-4d96-a999-8b6c4045270b" label="lyrics-like">idem autem Spfritus. Et divisiónes</l><l xml:id="m-002a8895-0324-404a-a5cb-eeb3c908b94b" facs="#m-9c0fe208-5193-4c62-b2ff-bb71bbd89cbf" label="lyrics-like">tio spirituum, álii génera linguárum,</l><l xml:id="m-3f106685-bf98-4b08-82e8-6155315a0c09" facs="#m-dbb11fbc-de76-4e60-a075-7a3b8adf6609" label="lyrics-like">álii interpretátio sermónum. Haec</l><l xml:id="m-14c9a7b2-aa34-4eb6-8a37-ff232009a02f" facs="#m-7e1d59dd-1895-4cd5-a044-fd006ff79d28" label="lyrics-like">ministratiónum sunt, idem autem</l><l xml:id="m-588e338d-6e94-44e0-bf3d-266d656027e8" facs="#m-91b9ad53-3742-45f0-a4a6-a5cce98219d4" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus. Et divisiónes operatió¬</l><l xml:id="m-a82163e3-f7b0-44a0-b433-57f9eba0da8d" facs="#m-26c833c0-163f-47e5-ac5a-236bad9ac3d3" label="lyrics-like">autem ómnia operátur unus atque</l><l xml:id="m-9edc0a0d-4b7c-4e8a-abca-54c024dcf922" facs="#m-6de6f2c0-1111-4d31-bab4-2b478cece92b" label="ambiguous">idem Spiritus, dividens singulis</l><l xml:id="m-58bec046-2a88-43a2-b44e-ba53f01df440" facs="#m-3ec32c86-0d14-4838-9f61-93b1846ba0b2" label="ambiguous">num sunt, idem vero Deus, qui ope¬</l><l xml:id="m-085f738b-3879-45a0-afd4-29de9267aab6" facs="#m-f340eb05-3cc0-4c0e-b95e-73651b0a261e" label="lyrics-like">rátur ómnia in ómnibus. Unicuique prout vult.</l><l xml:id="m-f6611622-1aa9-4d9e-8a4b-4df36a3370cd" facs="#m-d03fee4f-27d9-4b36-85a1-5433979cdc63" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-f2a74a04-3ace-4b74-a1db-12155250aa30" facs="#m-3b33807b-a5e8-468b-8ba6-85bd29a67232" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-58e98506-33b0-48b3-8eee-63dc06dc4367" facs="#m-1cb62d13-2247-47a3-a226-98089e707aaf" label="lyrics-like">Dó- mi- ne,</l><l xml:id="m-937c38c4-9f6c-4780-9aa5-95cf3f6ad54a" facs="#m-14f92237-885d-4d6d-a21c-963f8f8119cb" label="lyrics-like">AUstódi me,</l><l xml:id="m-b797160d-2fb0-4bb5-a9d4-c1068a590cb7" facs="#m-50817061-0692-4922-bcbe-398536fec11b" label="lyrics-like">ócu¬ li:</l><l xml:id="m-62502c43-cfd8-4ba6-a3fe-c3f4699254f6" facs="#m-29ee8b1f-3d61-4a9e-ab09-1ddeafbdc6c4" label="ambiguous">ut pupil¬ lam</l><l xml:id="m-af92b597-6f1d-4d1c-a4e7-85be89f1e31b" facs="#m-00c1f455-4834-402b-8053-23be0b451c14" label="lyrics-like">a-lá¬</l><l xml:id="m-01fa2b5a-cfdf-43d8-82e6-949660d82b46" facs="#m-426448e2-3335-45d0-98ec-9a5ad31d4e48" label="lyrics-like">sub úmbra</l><l xml:id="m-1a30c576-1ecf-44cd-808e-e95813850c5f" facs="#m-5c338c0d-66aa-4c23-a4e3-73d3b460e1ca" label="lyrics-like">rum tu¬ á¬</l><l xml:id="m-6764793d-5281-4c2d-a43c-0f150a3568be" facs="#m-a5562ba1-51b5-43bb-8046-d3e5b3cb6dcb" label="ambiguous">rum</l><l xml:id="m-619f9e21-3a41-41d6-805b-d6804fc6b97a" facs="#m-31ed64bf-f7e5-4b20-b04d-e8ce3ae3892f" label="lyrics-like">pró¬</l><l xml:id="m-ef192d4e-aa9f-4cf2-82e8-2e34add1c7c3" facs="#m-46c4ef66-6229-48d5-8353-93cee2ab670f" label="ambiguous">te¬</l><l xml:id="m-6bd4ed9c-64c8-4f18-bd68-79cf16707f59" facs="#m-494376b3-1438-4071-b522-fe9536bf126a" label="ambiguous">ge</l><l xml:id="m-4abf93f0-7b8c-493a-958c-4c1ea9c19573" facs="#m-65ac1e08-8718-498e-be58-67087a8f7b66" label="lyrics-like">V De vúltu tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d4c09c2-5654-455f-aa21-b0b9aad771fc" facs="#m-911567e4-1a87-448c-adda-0687bed04529" label="ambiguous">me.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
